Use the following:

  x <- read.cross("csv", "/powerplant/workspace/cfnnvt/rqtl/11_5",
                  "rqtl_fam_11_5_format.csv",
                  genotypes=c("AC","AD","BC","BD"), crosstype="4way")

- don't specify the alleles argument; that is not used for 4-way crosses, and can only be two alleles
- use the genotypes argument to specify the genotype codes that you are using in the file
- use the crosstype argument to specify the cross type

karl

